  "caveats": [
    "Regional layer is opt-in and remains disabled on the normal homepage. This compares the enabled developer preview, not default-page speed.",
    "Larger crowns increase pixel coverage while instance and mesh budgets remain unchanged. GPU intervals include CPU waits; nested CPU scopes must not be summed.",
    "Mobile is the quality budget on the same M1 and desktop viewport, not a phone viewport or real Android/iPhone hardware. Average FPS does not certify frame pacing.",
    "Coarse biome inputs, regional disk edges, global surface height handoff and local overlap still need visual refinement; readable trees alone do not pass full continuity acceptance."
  ],
